 “Gone Girl” is a great thriller until it stops being one, about 20 minutes before the finish Ben Affleck plays Nick, a guy with a cloud of sadness around him, who goes home to find that his wife, Amy (Rosamund Pike), is missing and that there are signs of a struggle Everyone who sees “Gone Girl” will walk out raving about Rosamund Pike

